Create a node that can be registered with `nodes register`

Usage: headscale debug create-node [OPTIONS] --key <KEY> --name <NAME>

Options:
  -c, --config <CONFIG>  config file (default is /etc/headscale/config.yaml) [env: HEADSCALE_CONFIG=]
  -u, --user <USER>      User
  -k, --key <KEY>        Registration key
      --name <NAME>      Node name
  -r, --route <ROUTES>   List (or repeated flags) of routes to advertise
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output format. Empty for human-readable, 'json', 'json-line' or 'yaml'
      --force            Disable prompts and forces the execution
  -h, --help             Print help
